{"id":"71e7b9f18ef1e42e","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/600_Åqvist_道义系统_F.md","title":"600 Åqvist 道义系统 F","display":"600_Åqvist_道义系统_F","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{600}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{600}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{obl}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{obl}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{600}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{600},\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{600},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{600}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{600},\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{600},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{obl}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{obl}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{obl}(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{obl}(A,B)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(A\\mid B)\">\\(O(A\\mid B)\\)</span>。下列符号不是原始构造子，而是本文件中的缩写：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\wedge B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\wedge(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\wedge B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\wedge(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式闭包\">2. 公式闭包</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{600}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{600}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(A\\mid B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\">\\(O(A\\mid B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>由第 1 节缩写定义，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\wedge B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\">\\(A\\wedge B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\">\\(A\\leftrightarrow B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由命题与替换\">3. 自由命题与替换</h1>\n<p>自由命题函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{600}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{600})\">\\(\\operatorname{PV}_{600}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{600})\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(O(A\\mid B))=\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(O(A\\mid B))=\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{600}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义有限支撑替换载体</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{600}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{600}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{600})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{600}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{600}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{600})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{600}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{600}\\)</span>，替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{600}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{600}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(B,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(B,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(O(A\\mid B),\\sigma)=O(\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(A,\\sigma)\\mid\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(B,\\sigma)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(O(A\\mid B),\\sigma)=O(\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(A,\\sigma)\\mid\\operatorname{Sub}_{600}(B,\\sigma)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统无绑定构造子；定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{600}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{600}(A)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{600}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{600}(A)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,600}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,600}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\)</span> 上的构造树相等。定义有类型的侧条件谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NonBot}_{600}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{NonBot}_{600}(A)=1\\Longleftrightarrow A\\not\\equiv_{\\alpha,600}\\bot.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NonBot}_{600}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{NonBot}_{600}(A)=1\\Longleftrightarrow A\\not\\equiv_{\\alpha,600}\\bot.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>此谓词只检查是否为字面的底公式，下面仅用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{OD}^{600}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{OD}^{600}\\)</span> 的句法守卫；它不检验可满足性或一致性。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\wedge C\">\\(B\\wedge C\\)</span> 的外层构造恒为否定，原合取参数上的字面非底检查对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\">\\(B,C\\)</span> 都成立，故 F 族及其证书不再附加这个恒真检查。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理族\">4. 公理族</h1>\n<p>命题公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{600}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{600}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{600}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{600}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{600}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{600}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Åqvist-E 核心二元义务公理族在本文件中定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{OK}^{600}\n=\n\\{O(A\\to B\\mid C)\\to(O(A\\mid C)\\to O(B\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{OK}^{600}\n=\n\\{O(A\\to B\\mid C)\\to(O(A\\mid C)\\to O(B\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{OConj}^{600}\n=\n\\{O(A\\mid C)\\to(O(B\\mid C)\\to O(A\\wedge B\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{OConj}^{600}\n=\n\\{O(A\\mid C)\\to(O(B\\mid C)\\to O(A\\wedge B\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{OSimp}^{600}\n=\n\\{O(A\\wedge B\\mid C)\\to O(A\\mid C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{OSimp}^{600}\n=\n\\{O(A\\wedge B\\mid C)\\to O(A\\mid C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{OD}^{600}\n=\n\\{O(A\\mid C)\\to\\neg O(\\neg A\\mid C):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600},\\operatorname{NonBot}_{600}(C)=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{OD}^{600}\n=\n\\{O(A\\mid C)\\to\\neg O(\\neg A\\mid C):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600},\\operatorname{NonBot}_{600}(C)=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>F 的条件强化族对所有公式参数适用：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{F}^{600}\n=\n\\{O(A\\mid B)\\to O(A\\mid B\\wedge C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{F}^{600}\n=\n\\{O(A\\mid B)\\to O(A\\mid B\\wedge C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{600}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{600}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{600}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{600}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{OK}^{600}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{OConj}^{600}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{OSimp}^{600}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{OD}^{600}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{F}^{600}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{600}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{600}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{600}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{600}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{OK}^{600}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{OConj}^{600}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{OSimp}^{600}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{OD}^{600}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{F}^{600}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>MP 规则关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{600}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{600}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>义务后件等价替换规则关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{REA}^{600}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B),O(A\\mid C)\\to O(B\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{REA}^{600}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B),O(A\\mid C)\\to O(B\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>义务条件等价替换规则关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{REC}^{600}\n=\n\\{((B\\leftrightarrow C),O(A\\mid B)\\to O(A\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{REC}^{600}\n=\n\\{((B\\leftrightarrow C),O(A\\mid B)\\to O(A\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示分式与总规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{600}A\\leftrightarrow B}{\\vdash_{600}O(A\\mid C)\\to O(B\\mid C)}\\;(REA),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{600}B\\leftrightarrow C}{\\vdash_{600}O(A\\mid B)\\to O(A\\mid C)}\\;(REC),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{600}A\\leftrightarrow B}{\\vdash_{600}O(A\\mid C)\\to O(B\\mid C)}\\;(REA),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{600}B\\leftrightarrow C}{\\vdash_{600}O(A\\mid B)\\to O(A\\mid C)}\\;(REC),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{600}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{600}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{REA}^{600}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{REC}^{600}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{600}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{600}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{REA}^{600}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{REC}^{600}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{600}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{600}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{600}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{600}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{600}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{600}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{REA}^{600}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{REA}^{600}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{REC}^{600}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{REC}^{600}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,600}A_i\">\\(A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,600}A_i\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{600}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{600}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{600}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{600}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{600}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{600}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{600}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{600}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{600}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{600}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{600}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{600}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{600}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{600}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-F-证书\">8. F 证书</h1>\n<p>可核验的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"600\">\\(600\\)</span>-F 证书集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{F}^{600}=\\{(A,B,C,D):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600},\\ \nD=B\\wedge C\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{F}^{600}=\\{(A,B,C,D):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600},\\ \nD=B\\wedge C\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B,C,D)\">\\((A,B,C,D)\\)</span> 的输出公式为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O(A\\mid B)\\to O(A\\mid B\\wedge C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O(A\\mid B)\\to O(A\\mid B\\wedge C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个证书的输出恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{F}^{600}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{F}^{600}\\)</span> 的一个实例，反之每个实例都有相应证书；即使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\bot\">\\(B=\\bot\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=(\\bot\\to\\bot)\">\\(C=(\\bot\\to\\bot)\\)</span> 也被无条件强化政策许可。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-语义结构与满足\">9. 语义结构与满足</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"600\">\\(600\\)</span>-选择函数模型类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SelMod}_{600}^{F}\">\\(\\mathsf{SelMod}_{600}^{F}\\)</span>。其元素为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Best}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Best}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{600}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{600}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Best}:\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Best}:\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Best}(X)\\subseteq X\">\\(\\operatorname{Best}(X)\\subseteq X\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(X\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Best}(X)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{Best}(X)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>；并且满足 F-强化约束</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Y\\subseteq X\\land Y\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{Best}(Y)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Best}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Y\\subseteq X\\land Y\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{Best}(Y)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Best}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>上述条件对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(X,Y\\in\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span> 适用。本条目明确接受其强制的恒等选择：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall X\\in\\mathcal P(W)\\quad\\operatorname{Best}(X)=X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall X\\in\\mathcal P(W)\\quad\\operatorname{Best}(X)=X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证明如下。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y=\\{x\\}\">\\(Y=\\{x\\}\\)</span>。非空性与子集条件给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Best}(Y)=\\{x\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Best}(Y)=\\{x\\}\\)</span>，强化约束给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\operatorname{Best}(X)\">\\(x\\in\\operatorname{Best}(X)\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\operatorname{Best}(X)\">\\(X\\subseteq\\operatorname{Best}(X)\\)</span>；反向包含是模型条件。空集由子集条件给出相同等式。反之，恒等选择满足全部上述条件。因此模型类非空，但没有非平凡的最佳世界筛选；条件义务下文实际检验条件扩张包含于后件扩张。</p>\n<p>公式真值集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ A⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M}\\subseteq W\">\\(⟦ A⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M}\\subseteq W\\)</span> 递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{atm}(p)⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{atm}(p)⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\neg A⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M}=W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n⟦ A\\to B⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\neg A⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M}=W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n⟦ A\\to B⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ O(A\\mid B)⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\begin{cases}\nW,&amp;\\operatorname{Best}(⟦ B⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq⟦ A⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M},\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\text{otherwise}.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ O(A\\mid B)⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\begin{cases}\nW,&amp;\\operatorname{Best}(⟦ B⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq⟦ A⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M},\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\text{otherwise}.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足与语义后承为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{600}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in⟦ A⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{600}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in⟦ A⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{600}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Best})\\in\\mathsf{SelMod}_{600}^{F}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{600}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{600}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{600}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Best})\\in\\mathsf{SelMod}_{600}^{F}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{600}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{600}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的句法呈现额外列出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{F}^{600}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{F}^{600}\\)</span> 的无条件条件强化族；与所列 E 核的比较限于公理清单，不据此断言严格后承增量。第 9 节的模型约束明确采用恒等选择，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(A\\mid B)\">\\(O(A\\mid B)\\)</span> 的语义条件等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ B⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M}\\subseteq⟦ A⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M}\">\\(⟦ B⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M}\\subseteq⟦ A⟧_{600}^{\\mathcal M}\\)</span>，不表示从条件扩张中进一步筛选最佳世界。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{AqF}_{600}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{600},\\mathsf{Frm}_{600},\\operatorname{PV}_{600},\\operatorname{BV}_{600},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{600},\\operatorname{Sub}_{600},\\equiv_{\\alpha,600},\n\\operatorname{NonBot}_{600},\\mathsf{Ax}_{600},\\mathsf{Rule}_{600},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{600},\\operatorname{last}_{600},\\vdash_{600},\\mathsf{Thm}_{600},\\mathsf{Cert}_{F}^{600},\n\\mathsf{SelMod}_{600}^{F},⟦-⟧_{600},\\Vdash_{600},\\models_{600}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{AqF}_{600}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{600},\\mathsf{Frm}_{600},\\operatorname{PV}_{600},\\operatorname{BV}_{600},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{600},\\operatorname{Sub}_{600},\\equiv_{\\alpha,600},\n\\operatorname{NonBot}_{600},\\mathsf{Ax}_{600},\\mathsf{Rule}_{600},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{600},\\operatorname{last}_{600},\\vdash_{600},\\mathsf{Thm}_{600},\\mathsf{Cert}_{F}^{600},\n\\mathsf{SelMod}_{600}^{F},⟦-⟧_{600},\\Vdash_{600},\\models_{600}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含 Åqvist F 的对象语言句法、公理族、规则关系、证明对象、可证性、选择函数义务语义、满足与语义后承；不在本条目中断言可靠性、完备性或可判定性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式闭包","text":"2. 公式闭包","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由命题与替换","text":"3. 自由命题与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理族","text":"4. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-F-证书","text":"8. F 证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-语义结构与满足","text":"9. 语义结构与满足","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{600}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{obl}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{600}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{600},\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{600},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{600},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{obl}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{600}^{2}\\